### SmartKB API 联调脚本（VSCode REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client 通用）

@host = http://localhost:5219
@token = 登录后把 token 粘贴到这里

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 登录（默认管理员）
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "SmartKB@2026" }

### 当前用户
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 知识库 ----------

### 建库（含台账双轨 + 字段 schema）
POST {{host}}/api/kbs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "合同库",
  "description": "采购与销售合同",
  "fieldSchemaJson": "[{\"name\":\"contract_no\",\"label\":\"合同编号\",\"type\":\"string\",\"filterable\":true},{\"name\":\"amount\",\"label\":\"金额\",\"type\":\"number\",\"filterable\":true}]",
  "enableLedger": true
}

### 知识库列表
GET {{host}}/api/kbs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 文档 ----------

### 上传文档（multipart）
POST {{host}}/api/kbs/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./../../Downloads/test.docx
------Boundary--

### 文档列表（观察解析状态）
GET {{host}}/api/kbs/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 重试失败文档
POST {{host}}/api/kbs/1/documents/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 授权 ----------

### 给用户 2 授予库 1 只读权限
POST {{host}}/api/kbs/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kbId": 1, "userId": 2, "roleId": null, "level": 1 }

### ---------- 会话 ----------

### 新建会话（之后在 /hubs/chat 用 SignalR 提问）
POST {{host}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "测试会话" }

### 会话历史
GET {{host}}/api/chats/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
